sequenceDiagram
    title STIR/SHAKEN Call Verification
    participant Caller
    participant OriginatingProvider
    participant RedfireSwitch
    participant CertificateAuthority
    participant Destination

    Caller ->> OriginatingProvider: INVITE +15551234567
    Note over Caller,OriginatingProvider: Outgoing call
    OriginatingProvider ->> RedfireSwitch: INVITE (with Identity header)
    Note over OriginatingProvider,RedfireSwitch: Call with STIR/SHAKEN identity
    RedfireSwitch ->> CertificateAuthority: Certificate Lookup
    Note over RedfireSwitch,CertificateAuthority: Verify certificate
    CertificateAuthority ->> RedfireSwitch: Certificate Valid
    Note over CertificateAuthority,RedfireSwitch: Certificate verification result
    RedfireSwitch ->> Destination: INVITE (verified)
    Note over RedfireSwitch,Destination: Forward verified call
